{"candidateAnswer":"father, brother","evidence":"[D17:28 | 9:49 am on 22 July, 2022] James: That's my sister and my dogs. We were just chilling together yesterday, and they bring so much happiness to my life.\n[D28:19 | 7:36 pm on 21 October, 2022] James: I'll reach out if I need help. Thanks for the resources, really appreciate it. By the way, my mother came to see me with her army friend two days ago. We had fun.","itemId":"urn:uuid:14fd0b84-081a-5590-ac7a-6b662fa61dea","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:8c7a3a56c3ac3d6e9a5033ec1cb010f5a26fe8937d3130778529394bde6beddd","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which of James's family members have visited him in the last year?","referenceAnswer":"mother, sister","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"8c7a3a56c3ac3d6e9a5033ec1cb010f5a26fe8937d3130778529394bde6beddd"}}]}